   189	
   190	## Gate results
   191	
   192	### Gate A — PASS
   193	
   194	- A1: the entry and loop claims pin the exact translated closure body,
   195	  parameter, binding, scopes, and builtins. No program-defined operation is
   196	  summarized away. The `5 -> 4` mutation invalidates the loop proof.
