   200	- A3: lookup, argument evaluation, loop control, `ord`, modulo, `chr`, return,
   201	  and frame restoration all execute under fixed semantics. Exact scopes rule
   202	  out shadow bindings. The arbitrary continuation is preserved.
   203	- A4: every proof-local equation is exhaustive, overlap-free, and either
   204	  nonrecursive or structurally decreasing. No false off-domain equation or
   205	  opaque value is present.
