   222	
   223	- All assumptions and exclusions are recorded below.
   224	- Every claimed concrete, differential, false-postcondition, and body-mutation
   225	  check has an existing artifact and exact command in `prove.sh`.
   226	- Formal proof, conditional trust, finite evidence, and excluded behavior are
   227	  distinguished here.
   228	
   229	## Trust boundary
   230	
   231	- The supplied read-only `reference-semantics/` definition is trusted as the
   232	  task's Python model. Every positive claim depends on its relevant function,
   233	  call, loop, string, integer, `ord`, and `chr` rules.
   234	- The supplied `py2mpy.py` translator is trusted to transliterate CPython AST
