   239	- No proof-local trusted primitive or opaque value affects the result, control,
   240	  state, or claims. Opaque facilities imported but unused from the broad
   241	  reference semantics are not on this proof's execution path.
   242	
   243	## Empirically supported facts
   244	
   245	- `concrete_test.py`/`concrete_test.mpy` checks the empty input, a simple
   246	  sequence, wraparound (`"c" -> "x"`), and a full rotated alphabet using LLVM
